attacks.effect:
4 hits of 75% damage, amounting to 300% damage and empowers the next basic attack with Bacon; applies one of the following effects;

  • If the target has more than 50% of its maximum HP remaining, this attack gains +50 Crit.

  • If the target has less than 50% of its maximum HP remaining, attack applies 'Dragon's Sear' (+50 Health Resist) to target for 3 turns inclusive.

Recovers 15 MP; deals damage based on weapon type;

  • With a Staff/Wand/Dagger/Scythe equipped, 1 hit of 100% damage.

  • With any other weapon item type equipped, 1 hit of 50% damage.

Initiates a 3-turn counter that, when expired, adds an additional attack type before any skill, at random;

  • If  Knight Minion or  Mage Minion attacks: 2 hits of scaled damage.

  • If  Commander Minion attacks: 3 hits of scaled damage.

